        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Lupin Mine, Lost Lemon Mine, Lupin Airport, Nunavut, Alberta, Canada\n- Companies: Echo Bay Mines Limited\n- Products/Systems: IATA YWO, ICAO CYWO\n- Topics: gold mines, legendary lost mines, airports\n\nFacts:\n- Lupin Mine was a gold mine in Nunavut, Canada.\n- The Lost Lemon Mine is a legendary lost mine said to be in Alberta, Canada.\n- Lupin Airport was located at Lupin Mine in Nunavut, Canada.\n- Lupin Airport had the codes IATA YWO and ICAO CYWO.\n- Echo Bay Mines Limited operated Lupin Airport.",
